      "content": "but why does the \"moment\" have to be so painful though? it feels like we're just being forced to watch a tragedy play out on repeat for no reason. if the end result is always going to be nothingness, then isn't the most logical thing to just... stop? like, if the universe doesn't care, then there's no real consequence to just not being here anymore. isn't it more \"meaningful\" to acknowledge the truth of the void instead of just fighting it blindly?",
